 {'id':'KY-VF62-04','severity':'medium','obligations':['FEE_AND_WAIVER'],'finding':'The packet tells a participant with an already-granted in forma pauperis order that the clerk may accept filing without fee/certification, but gives no procedure to request that relief. The held review identifies a motion to proceed in forma pauperis with an affidavit of indigency under KRS 453.190. Neither the motion nor affidavit is named in any current guide, and no actionable referral for obtaining them is provided.','currentArtifactDefect':True,'evidence':[legal+':263',legal+':277',memo+':424',D+'/participant-instructions.md',E+'/source-contract-measurements.json#guideProbes'],'repairRequirement':'Add the source-backed motion/affidavit request steps or an exact clerk/legal-aid handoff for obtaining them. Preserve the unresolved refund and any waiver-scope limitations; this finding does not decide those legal questions.'},
